<p>Your will is a shield against assaults from crazed arcane users.</p><p>Each time that you take damage from a spell, you punish the spellcaster with <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Willpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">40, 70, 120, 170, 220</acronym> mind damage.</p><p>Also, they will suffer a 35% spell failure chance (with duration equal to the cooldown of the spell they used on you).</p><p>Note: this talent has a cooldown.</p>